            <ArticleTitle>A one-year statistical analysis of dental emergencies in a pediatric hospital.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>959-62, 966-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Data on 1,373 emergency dental visits to a pediatric hospital during a calendar year period were reviewed. Chief complaints were categorized and the associated pathological conditions were identified and analyzed. A classification of pediatric dental emergencies is presented.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
